        "original_id": "174f0802-db27-5a51-a8bd-075426ffcba4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kareena Kapoor, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Abhishek Bachchan, Karan Johar, Yash Johar\n- Films: Refugee, Kabhi Khushi Kabhie Gham... (K3G)\n- Awards: Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut\n- Topics: Kareena Kapoor filmography, Bollywood films\n\nFacts:\n- Kareena Kapoor, also credited as Kareena Kapoor Khan, is an Indian actress who has appeared in over 50 Bollywood films.\n- In 2000, Kareena Kapoor made her acting debut opposite Abhishek Bachchan in the drama film Refugee.\n- In 2000, Refugee earned Kareena Kapoor the Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut.\n- In 2001, Kabhi Khushi Kabhie Gham..., also known as K3G, was released as an Indian family drama film.\n- Karan Johar wrote and directed Kabhi Khushi Kabhie Gham....\n- Yash Johar produced Kabhi Khushi Kabhie Gham....",
